          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, address, right column",
          "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">\u200b\u200bTo my master and mentor Ab\u016b Ya\u1e25y\u0101 Nahray b. Nissim, (may he) R(est in) E(den), may God lengthen life, preserve his well-being, happiness and health.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u00a0</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">(Arabic script): To my master and mentor Ab\u016b Ya\u1e25y\u0101 Nahray b. Nissim al- Maghrib\u012b, may God lengthen his life, preserve his well-being and health.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>",
