      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, address, left column",
          "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">From his loving \u2018Ayy\u0101sh b. \u1e62adaqa (may he) R(est in) E(den).</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">(Arabic script) To be delivered to Q\u0101sim the broker; B\u016b\u1e63\u012br, God willing. To be delivered to Nahray b. Nissim, from \u02bfAyy\u0101sh b. \u1e62adaqa. To be delivered to Q\u0101sim the broker B\u016b\u1e63\u012br, God willing.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
